{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project Prison: Demo - Your First Week Inside</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the harsh realities of prison life in this sandbox simulation/RPG demo. This demo contains all the core gameplay mechanics of the full <i>Project Prison</i> experience, but within a limited timeframe \u2013 your first seven days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Full Week Behind Bars:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through your first seven days in prison.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the core gameplay loop in a condensed format.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn Your Keep:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work legitimate jobs (kitchen, workshop) to earn essential cash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the value of money in a cutthroat environment.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Inmate:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exercise to increase your physical strength.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study in the library to gain valuable knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start shaping your character's future path.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate the Prison:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a selection of prison blocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with other inmates \u2013 your actions have consequences.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gang Awareness:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the influence of different prison gangs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin to understand the complex power dynamics.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Hustle:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start dabbling in illegal trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make some early connections (or enemies).</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All Core Mechanics Present:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo allows players to use all core features of the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get full understanding what awaits in full game.</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519840?t=1760271138","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760271138","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519840/ea5cc37ab5f7a8b132ec1108e98d07437a620bb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760271138","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519840/ea5cc37ab5f7a8b132ec1108e98d07437a620bb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760271138","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game has mild levels of violence. Also contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: General Mature Content\r\n\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project Prison: Demo - Your First Week Inside</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the harsh realities of prison life in this sandbox simulation/RPG demo. This demo contains all the core gameplay mechanics of the full <i>Project Prison</i> experience, but within a limited timeframe \u2013 your first seven days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Full Week Behind Bars:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through your first se